[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:91. Poor Ian]
[00:00.800]Lesson 91 | 第91课
[00:03.815]Has Mr. West sold his house yet? | 威斯特先生把他的房子卖了吗？
[00:08.095]Yes, he has. | 是的，他卖了。
[00:09.795]He sold it last week. | 他上星期把它卖掉了。
[00:11.625]Has he moved to his new house yet? | 他搬进新家了吗？
[00:14.380]No, not yet. | 不，还没有。
[00:16.330]He's still here. | 他还在这儿。
[00:17.985]He's going to move tomorrow. | 他打算明天搬家。
[00:20.200]When? | 什么时候？
[00:21.115]Tomorrow morning? | 明天上午吗？
[00:22.555]No. | 不。
[00:23.660]Tomorrow afternoon. | 明天下午。
[00:25.735]I shall miss him. | 我会想念他的。
[00:27.730]He has always been a good neighbour. | 他一直是个好邻居。
[00:30.820]He's a very nice person. | 他是个很好的人。
[00:33.010]We shall all miss him. | 我们都会想念他的。
[00:35.425]When will the new people move into this house? | 新房客什么时候搬进这所房子？
[00:39.080]I think that they will move in the day after tomorrow. | 我想他们会在后天搬进来。
[00:42.950]Will you see Mr. West today, Mrs. Brown? | 布朗夫人，你今天会见到威斯特先生吗？
[00:46.385]Yes, I shall. | 是的，我会的。
[00:48.140]Please give him my regards. | 请代我向他问好。
[00:50.780]Poor Mr. West! | 可怜的威斯特先生！
[00:52.890]He didn't want to leave this house. | 他不想离开这所房子。
[00:55.245]No. | 不。
[00:56.270]He didn't want to leave, but his wife did. | 他不想离开，可他妻子想。